<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">PASO A PASO</view><view class="title">从一句话，到一个世界。</view><view class="subtitle">A1 → A2 → B1 → B2 · 32 单元 · 320 词条 · 128 道语法题</view>
<button hover-class="button-press" class="primary" bindtap="drills">A1 → B2 递进练习 →</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" bindtap="bank">进入 6500 词库 →</button><view class="level-tabs"><button hover-class="button-press" wx:for="{{levels}}" wx:key="id" class="{{level === item.id ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" data-level="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select">{{item.id}}</button></view>
<block wx:for="{{levels}}" wx:key="id"><view wx:if="{{item.id === level}}" class="card"><view class="list-title">{{item.id}} · {{item.title}}</view><view class="body">{{item.goal}}</view><view class="small body">词汇 {{item.learned}} / {{item.total}} · 完成 {{item.completed}} / {{item.unitTotal}} 单元 · 输出形式完成 {{item.expressions}} 次</view><view class="small">表达目标：{{item.target}}</view></view></block>
<view class="note">前一单元至少 6 个词完成记忆确认且语法达 75%，解锁下一单元。各阶段每 10 词有表达任务，复用旧词。课内 320 张词卡配有原创例句；扩展词库提供 6500 个去重条目，学习进度不代表考试等级。</view>
<view wx:for="{{units}}" wx:key="id" class="card {{item.locked ? 'locked' : ''}}"><view class="row"><view class="eyebrow">{{item.levelCode}} · UNIDAD {{item.number}}</view><view class="pill">{{item.locked ? '待解锁' : item.complete ? '已完成' : '可学习'}}</view></view><view class="section-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.goal}}</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="small">已学习 {{item.learned}} / {{item.total}} · 记忆确认 {{item.ready}} / {{item.total}} · 语法 {{item.passed ? '已达标 ✓' : '待练习'}}</view><view class="row body"><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.lessonId}}" data-locked="{{item.locked}}" bindtap="open">语法练习 →</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.taskId}}" bindtap="expression">词汇串联 →</button></view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="list-title">综合输出：给城市写一份学习提案</view><view class="body muted">跨 A1–B2 复用词汇，写出背景、目标、措施、局限与结论。</view><button hover-class="button-press" class="primary" data-id="final" bindtap="expression">{{finalUnlocked ? '开始综合任务 →' : '预览最终任务 →'}}</button></view></view>
